        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Acquired in 1864 as part of the collection of Dr. Franz Bock.\n\nHistorical significance: A very well-preserved example of 14th century Italian velvet, illustrating a pomegranate motif, a key feature of luxury textile design of this period, as well as the use of polychrome silks and gold thread."@en .

